Short : HD-Installer for Aquaventura Enhanced V2.0b
Type : game/patch
Author : Bored Seal, StingRay

This patch applies to "Aquaventura" by Psygnosis (c) 1992 - 2 disks.
Slave requires WHDLOAD V17+, install requires RawDIC.
Game requires 0.5 MB Chip RAM (+ 2.0 MB other RAM for PRELOAD option)
Enhanced framerate requires a 68020 or better and 108 KB more Fast RAM

FEATURES:
- Full load from HD
- Copy/Disk protection removed
- ButtonWait tooltype added for title picture and Psygnosis logo
- NI/ROM icon (created by JHZ)
- Quit option (your default key)
- Enhanced framerate (CUSTOM1=1, on in the supplied icon): the game runs at
  the speed of an A500 and draws up to 50 frames a second with smooth
  movement, as fast as the Amiga allows
- Game speed (CUSTOM2, with Enhanced framerate): 0 = 6 fields a game step
  (an A500 on average), 1 = 5 fields (faster), 2 = 7 fields, 3 = 8 fields

HISTORY:
V2.0b (22.11.2026) - new option Enhanced framerate (CUSTOM1), on in the
                     supplied icon: the game's code runs from Fast RAM, the
                     game steps at the speed of an A500, and the frames that
                     fit between two steps show the movement in between
                   - new option Game speed (CUSTOM2)
                   - without CUSTOM1 the game runs as with V1.3
                   - requires WHDLoad 17 or newer
V1.0 (13-Aug-2000) - first public release
V1.1 (22-Oct-2000) - CACR operation removed (thanks to Mr.Larmer for report)
V1.2 (29-Jun-2006) - disk access removed (2x), taglist termination fixed to
                     work with WHDLoad v16.6
V1.3 (22-Dec-2016) - 68000 quitkey support
 done by StingRay  - default quitkey changed to Del (F10 used to enable cheat)
		   - WHDLoad v17+ features used (config)
		   - new install script
CHEAT:
- At the option screen press CTRL, F10 and joystick button at one moment.
  You got infinite energy and you can use 'L' and 'T' for skip level or
  tunnel sections.

